WEBVTT

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:06.190
My grandma ordered me to make
a delivery far from the city.

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:08.060
Duel sanctuary?

00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:12.990
A strange old man was waiting for us
at the duel training facility.

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:22.580
The old man and I dueled using
wooden statues of legendary monsters!

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:26.720
But for some reason,
I turned into a monster!

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:39.140
Just when I was about to learn something,
I had to duel the old man’s former student!

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:41.640
Yuma, I’ll fight too.

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:45.730
Since I’m his student, I won’t
forgive anyone who insults the old man!

00:00:45.730 --> 00:00:48.020
I’m kattobing!

00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:06.500
I set two cards
and end my turn!

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:13.470
I promise to defeat you with my
monsters- No, I mean with my friends!

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:18.000
You’re like the light
on a cloudless day.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.830
You adore your master.

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:23.970
I’ll show you that light
can’t cut through the darkness!

00:01:23.970 --> 00:01:26.350
The darkness swallows the light!

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:29.110
Do your best, Yuma!

00:01:29.540 --> 00:01:33.010
There’s something scary about this duel.

00:01:33.010 --> 00:01:37.430
He’s darker than before.

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:39.690
Here I go!

00:01:39.690 --> 00:01:41.990
My turn! I draw!

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:47.260
I can summon this monster
by lowering its ATK by 500!

00:01:47.260 --> 00:01:49.770
Come, Dododo Warrior!

00:01:56.750 --> 00:01:59.090
You’re in a rush
to fill your field.

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:07.560
If you tributed Gagaga Magician to summon Dododo Warrior,
it would’ve had more ATK than Blade Armor Ninja.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:12.990
Why did Yuma keep Gagaga Magician
if it lowered Dododo Warrior’s ATK?

00:02:12.990 --> 00:02:14.030
Yuma’s thinking that....

00:02:14.030 --> 00:02:18.240
Yuma, you want to protect
your monsters, no matter what?

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:20.200
Do you have
a problem with that?

00:02:20.590 --> 00:02:21.440
No.

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:23.500
Here I go!

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:27.410
I activate the spell card
Full-Force Strike from my hand!

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:35.960
When my monster battles, neither of us takes damage,
and your monster is destroyed!

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:39.930
Dododo Warrior attacks Blade Armor Ninja!

00:02:39.930 --> 00:02:43.660
Go! Dododo Axe!

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:47.020
I flip over my Continuous Trap!

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:50.260
Armor Ninjitsu Art of Freezing!

00:02:50.260 --> 00:02:55.230
When there’s a Ninja on my field,
your monster’s attack ends.

00:02:55.230 --> 00:03:02.160
As long as I have this Continuous Trap,
your monsters can’t change battle position.

00:03:03.010 --> 00:03:04.950
I see what he did.

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:06.810
I’m not done!

00:03:06.810 --> 00:03:10.490
I can’t afford
to lose this duel!

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:19.670
Whether it’s rain, wind,
blizzard or the scorching sun

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:22.800
They give color to each day
Will and love keep me from losing heart

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:25.600
Your kindness was harsh
I learned frustration when we clashed

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:29.980
Freedom begins by accepting differences Dance and create the universe

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:37.360
In truth, I was sad until I met you

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:43.790
I lied, thinking it was easier to be alone

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:50.460
Even though we don’t like the same books or hobbies

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:54.330
You’re the only one who agreed with me

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:57.460
Joy and sadness and anger and do re mi fa so la ti do

00:03:57.460 --> 00:03:59.200
There’s no harmony and scenario without differences

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:02.630
Everyone is not the same

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:07.560
That’s the reason for living

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:12.810
Even if the sounds are dissonant at times

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:18.230
That’s why I never give up
I believe my strength will get me through

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:21.490
I travel to the edge of the world

00:04:22.010 --> 00:04:25.950
The sights I see with you are the truth

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:28.790
Whether it’s rain, wind, blizzard or the scorching sun

00:04:28.790 --> 00:04:32.040
They give color to each day
Will and love keep me from losing heart

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:35.420
Your kindness was harsh
I learned frustration when we clashed

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:39.090
Freedom begins by accepting differences Dance and create the universe

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:49.850
\hSpecial Ninjitsu Art! The Mightiest Ninja Appears!\h

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:49.850
Number 16:

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:46.970
I set one card and end my turn!

00:04:48.030 --> 00:04:49.850
My turn. I draw!

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:52.480
I activate Spy Attack from my hand.

00:04:53.020 --> 00:05:00.170
I send one monster in my hand to the graveyard to look at your set card.

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:03.030
Aqua Armor Ninja!

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:07.820
In exchange for your life, sneak into the enemy’s territory and reveal the set card’s identity!

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:14.580
He’s willing to sacrifice his monsters to win.

00:05:15.010 --> 00:05:17.390
That’s his dueling style.

00:05:18.590 --> 00:05:19.840
This card is...

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:21.800
Yuma...

00:05:22.350 --> 00:05:26.470
So that’s how Yuma duels.

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:29.830
Roku, did you teach him this?

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:31.850
Haru!

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:34.930
Long time no see!

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:35.770
And his sister!

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:39.740
Like I thought, Yuma is dueling!

00:05:39.740 --> 00:05:40.860
Sis!

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:43.070
Yuma, you’re dueling again—

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:44.580
Wait.

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:50.760
He’s seriously trying
to surpass himself right now.

00:05:51.690 --> 00:05:53.660
Trust him.

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:56.960
That’s your duty as his sister.

00:05:57.800 --> 00:05:59.120
Sis...

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:01.300
Concentrate, Yuma.

00:06:01.740 --> 00:06:04.460
They’ve gathered to watch you die.

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:07.680
I’ll let them see your death!

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:10.850
Blade Armor Ninja attacks Gagaga Magician!

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:13.970
Electromagnetic Sword Mist Slash!

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:18.730
Take a second strike!

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:23.860
I use an Overlay Unit to attack your monster again!

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:27.820
Blade Armor Ninja attacks Dododo Warrior!

00:06:32.170 --> 00:06:34.790
Your set card is Gagagaback.

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:39.810
It resurrects a monster in exchange for 600 LP.

00:06:40.570 --> 00:06:43.580
You’re doing whatever it takes
to protect your monsters!

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:46.200
600 LP per monster?

00:06:46.200 --> 00:06:49.720
It’s not worth paying that much to resurrect a monster!

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:51.710
Yuma...

00:06:51.710 --> 00:06:55.180
I’ll show you that resurrection is foolish!

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:59.140
I flip over my Continuous Trap,
Armor Ninjitsu Art of Rust Mist!

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:05.530
As long as I have a Ninja, your Special Summoned monsters’ ATK are halved.

00:07:07.670 --> 00:07:10.760
Now try to save your friends!

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:13.660
Your current situation is worse than before!

00:07:15.610 --> 00:07:17.430
Yuma, don’t be confused.

00:07:17.430 --> 00:07:19.440
Carry through with your own ideas.

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:21.080
Fight with your heart.

00:07:21.770 --> 00:07:28.680
The master’s teachings don’t seem logical at first, but I feel it will lead to victory.

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:30.350
I want to see that.

00:07:30.350 --> 00:07:32.050
Astral...

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:36.250
I activate the Quick-Play Spell Gagagaback!

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:43.940
When Gagaga Magician is destroyed in battle, it resurrects along with its monster friend!

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:51.450
But I take 600 points of damage
for every resurrected monster!

00:07:57.740 --> 00:07:58.740
Yuma!

00:07:59.140 --> 00:08:01.450
300 LP...

00:08:01.450 --> 00:08:03.020
Yuma...

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:14.630
Due to the Continuous Trap Armor Ninjitsu Art of Rust Mist’s effect, the Special Summoned monsters’ ATK are halved.

00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:18.410
I end my turn.

00:08:20.010 --> 00:08:22.230
Why do you care so much
about your monsters?

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:26.610
They have fewer ATK, and your LP
are like a candle in the wind.

00:08:27.780 --> 00:08:31.110
Are you and your monsters
committing suicide?

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:33.240
I trust my friends.

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:37.110
My feelings will someday reach my monsters!

00:08:37.110 --> 00:08:40.410
They will save me!

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:42.750
Reach them?

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:44.760
Save the monsters?

00:08:44.760 --> 00:08:47.390
Monsters aren’t your friends!

00:08:47.390 --> 00:08:50.380
They’re a duelist’s servants!

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:54.260
I couldn’t stand those awful teachings!

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:58.970
You must use darkness
and fear to conquer a duel!

00:08:59.520 --> 00:09:02.680
You’re wrong! That’s not a duel!

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:07.860
You talk big, but you only have 300 LP.

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:15.280
If your friends don’t save you
before you reach 0 LP, you lose.

00:09:17.880 --> 00:09:20.610
I believe in my monsters—

00:09:20.610 --> 00:09:24.040
I mean, I believe in my friends!

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:26.000
My turn! I draw!

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:29.450
All right! It’s here!

00:09:29.450 --> 00:09:32.520
I activate the spell card Gagaga Bolt!

00:09:32.520 --> 00:09:38.430
When there’s a Gagaga monster on my field, one card on your field is destroyed!

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:41.810
I destroy Blade Armor Ninja!

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:46.980
What?

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:51.320
Then Gagaga Magician attacks you directly!

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:58.530
Then Dododo Warrior attacks you directly!

00:09:58.530 --> 00:10:00.700
Go!

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:02.720
I won’t let you do that!

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:05.960
I activate Aqua Armor Ninja’s
effect from my graveyard!

00:10:06.550 --> 00:10:11.880
I banish this card to negate
your monster’s direct attack!

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:14.260
My friends, answer me!

00:10:14.260 --> 00:10:20.270
When Dododo Warrior attacks, your spell, trap and monster effects are negated!

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:21.470
What?

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:26.730
Rust Mist and Aqua’s effects are gone, so I can attack you directly!

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:29.730
Go, Dododo Warrior!

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:32.160
Dododo Axe!

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:35.650
What?

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:43.190
Hooray!

00:10:43.190 --> 00:10:46.570
I set one card and end my turn!

00:10:48.910 --> 00:10:50.620
Did you see what I did?

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:56.240
My feelings reached my friends!

00:10:56.240 --> 00:10:59.370
We’re not the only ones battling in this duel!

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:01.780
That’s how my friends responded!

00:11:01.780 --> 00:11:05.510
That’s what my master Rokujuro taught me!

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:07.480
Whatever.

00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:09.680
Enough with those old man’s teachings.

00:11:09.680 --> 00:11:13.890
I’ve surpassed my master and his teachings!

00:11:13.890 --> 00:11:15.520
I have no friends.

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:17.490
I don’t trust anyone.

00:11:17.490 --> 00:11:21.030
I fight and win alone!

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:23.040
My turn! I draw!

00:11:23.770 --> 00:11:26.290
I activate a spell card!

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:28.950
Armor Ninjitsu Art of Alchemy!

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:32.790
All Ninjitsu Art cards on my field are destroyed.

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:35.750
You’re destroying your own traps?

00:11:36.720 --> 00:11:39.880
Then I draw two cards from my deck.

00:11:42.030 --> 00:11:43.590
What are you planning?

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:49.980
When monsters are only on your side of the field, I can Special Summon Earth Armor Ninja.

00:11:57.210 --> 00:11:59.150
He’s acting weird.

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:04.370
I activate the spell card
Armor Ninjitsu Art of Revival.

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:08.440
I Special Summon one Ninja monster
from my graveyard.

00:12:08.440 --> 00:12:10.500
Come, Flame Armor Ninja!

00:12:12.060 --> 00:12:16.390
When Flame is successfully
summoned, it gains 1 Level.

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:22.190
He’s a Number!

00:12:22.190 --> 00:12:23.720
No way...

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:29.430
I’ll swallow your light, kid!

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:34.060
I overlay Level 5 Earth Armor Ninja
and Flame Armor Ninja!

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:40.840
With these two monsters,
I build the Overlay Network.

00:12:40.840 --> 00:12:42.920
Xyz Summon!

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:45.760
Come, Number 12!

00:12:51.730 --> 00:12:55.630
Crimson Shadow Armor Ninja!

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:07.220
This monster is my true power!

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:08.890
The darkness among the darkness!

00:13:08.890 --> 00:13:12.560
Crimson Shadow, envelop him in darkness!

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:14.200
A Number!

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:19.150
A Number appeared after we’ve come this far?

00:13:20.210 --> 00:13:23.150
Damn! He has a Number!

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:27.870
This monster pulled Yamikawa
deeper into the darkness.

00:13:28.480 --> 00:13:29.780
Yuma...

00:13:31.820 --> 00:13:35.370
Feel the mightiest ninja’s attack!

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:38.960
Crimson Shadow attacks Gagaga Magician!

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:40.120
This is bad!

00:13:40.120 --> 00:13:41.620
Yuma, the trap card!

00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:42.840
That’s right!

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:45.800
I flip over the trap card Guts Guard!

00:13:46.570 --> 00:13:53.520
With this card, I can switch the attack target to a different monster on my field.

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:58.500
I switch the attack target from Gagaga Magician to Dododo Warrior!

00:13:58.500 --> 00:14:02.780
And the new attack target isn’t destroyed!

00:14:09.560 --> 00:14:12.740
Resistance is futile. I end my turn.

00:14:14.810 --> 00:14:17.210
That saved me.

00:14:18.020 --> 00:14:21.170
But when the next attack comes...

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:23.240
Pull yourself together, Yuma!

00:14:23.240 --> 00:14:26.760
If he only had duel food...

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:30.600
It’s tough when you’re hungry.

00:14:32.160 --> 00:14:33.460
Hey!

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:38.390
What’s wrong, kid? Are you done?

00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:41.860
Do you no longer have the power to trust your friends?

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:48.850
Yuma, remember the master’s words and how you felt when you were a monster!

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:54.330
Don’t do it!

00:14:54.780 --> 00:14:56.920
Don’t do it!

00:14:58.260 --> 00:15:01.880
You understand how a monster feels.

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:05.670
Your desire to answer the monsters’ feelings will truly move a monster.

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:08.970
Monsters’ feelings...

00:15:27.390 --> 00:15:28.780
That was...

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:30.620
The monsters...

00:15:33.020 --> 00:15:34.980
That’s right!

00:15:34.980 --> 00:15:37.660
It doesn’t matter if it’s a Number!

00:15:38.760 --> 00:15:43.270
I’m going to overcome this
situation with my friends!

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:45.710
Yuma!

00:15:46.940 --> 00:15:48.380
Duel food!

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:50.340
Thanks!

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:54.380
Thank you, Kotori.

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:58.740
I’m kattobing!

00:15:58.740 --> 00:16:00.990
My turn! I draw!

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:04.730
It’s here!

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:08.280
I activate the Quick-Play Spell, Decrease!

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:13.610
With this card, I can lower a monster’s Level by 2!

00:16:14.190 --> 00:16:18.910
I change Dododo Warrior’s Level from 6 to 4!

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:23.540
I overlay Level 4 Gagaga Magician
and Dododo Warrior!

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:29.600
With these two monsters,
I build the Overlay Network.

00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:31.630
Xyz Summon!

00:16:33.480 --> 00:16:37.550
Come, Number 39: Utopia!

00:16:41.390 --> 00:16:42.420
All right!

00:16:42.420 --> 00:16:45.190
Yuma, I see the formula for victory.

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:46.290
Yeah!

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:50.150
Utopia attacks Crimson Shadow!

00:16:57.710 --> 00:16:59.830
Hope Sword Slash!

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:09.340
You did it, Utopia!

00:17:12.690 --> 00:17:15.450
The darkness can’t be sealed away!

00:17:15.450 --> 00:17:17.930
Crimson Shadow’s effect activates!

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:23.630
I use one Overlay Unit
to negate Crimson Shadow’s destruction!

00:17:27.140 --> 00:17:30.270
I activate the Quick-Play Spell,
Revenge Attack!

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:37.770
Revenge Attack activates when a monster on my field fails to destroy your monster in battle.

00:17:37.770 --> 00:17:41.910
Utopia gains 1000 ATK and can battle again!

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:42.870
What?

00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:57.720
What’s this light?

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:01.930
This is Utopia’s power.

00:18:02.340 --> 00:18:04.300
The light of hope!

00:18:04.300 --> 00:18:06.440
Cut through the darkness!

00:18:06.440 --> 00:18:07.890
Hope Sword Slash!

00:18:13.850 --> 00:18:15.070
The darkness...

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:47.280
Yuma!

00:18:47.280 --> 00:18:48.540
How’s that!

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:54.520
Yuma and dueling can’t be separated.

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:58.020
I’m glad that I left him in your care.

00:18:58.020 --> 00:19:03.560
It was his destiny to realize
his own power sooner or later.

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:05.200
Of course I knew I would win!

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:07.930
What are you talking
about? It was close!

00:19:07.930 --> 00:19:09.620
Yeah!

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:11.290
C’mon...

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:37.280
Move, kid!

00:19:37.640 --> 00:19:41.050
Can’t you see the scar on this wooden statue?

00:19:41.050 --> 00:19:44.230
It shows the old man worked hard to fix it!

00:19:46.560 --> 00:19:49.500
This monster is your friend.

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:52.570
A dear friend!

00:20:21.800 --> 00:20:26.120
I wanted power.

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:30.200
But I could only find it within darkness.

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:34.080
The darkness is gone.

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:36.800
The rest is up to you.

00:20:36.800 --> 00:20:38.410
Master...

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:50.060
Yamikawa is going to retrain.

00:20:50.590 --> 00:20:52.220
Let’s battle again sometime!

00:20:52.220 --> 00:20:55.560
With your monsters—
I mean, your friends!

00:20:56.430 --> 00:20:57.530
Yeah.

00:21:00.300 --> 00:21:01.960
Oh oh!

00:21:01.960 --> 00:21:04.410
So you were dueling!

00:21:04.940 --> 00:21:07.480
I guess I have no choice.

00:21:07.480 --> 00:21:11.050
But don’t duel too much.

00:21:12.880 --> 00:21:14.680
Hooray!

00:21:16.470 --> 00:21:18.080
Congratulations, Yuma!

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:20.090
This is the the duel sanctuary’s secret deck.

00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:23.050
You’re the right person to have this deck.

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:27.010
This deck should respond to your feelings.

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:29.120
I can have it?

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:30.010
Yeah.

00:21:33.430 --> 00:21:34.930
Woohoo!

00:21:34.930 --> 00:21:36.630
That’s awesome!

00:21:36.630 --> 00:21:40.510
Now you can strengthen your deck for the World Duel Carnival!

00:21:41.070 --> 00:21:44.530
Yuma, you’re planning to enter?

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:45.800
Yeah!

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:47.860
There’s someone I need to defeat!

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:49.780
Right, Astral—

00:21:50.480 --> 00:21:51.830
He’s not here.

00:21:54.890 --> 00:21:58.040
Yuma was able to recover.

00:21:59.890 --> 00:22:06.500
But can I defeat Kaito?

00:22:13.160 --> 00:22:15.650
Let’s start the duel!

00:22:15.650 --> 00:22:17.320
This week’s quiz:

00:22:17.320 --> 00:22:21.110
How many cards do you need in your deck?

00:22:21.110 --> 00:22:24.820
20? 30? Or 40?

00:22:30.030 --> 00:22:34.940
Today’s test is hard
Can’t avoid pleasure and temptation

00:22:34.940 --> 00:22:39.880
I want to go home and watch TV
Recent cartoons are entertaining

00:22:49.800 --> 00:22:54.520
Anyway, tests are hard
Language, math and English are especially hard

00:22:54.520 --> 00:22:59.480
Average scores in science and social studies
I’m only good at P.E.

00:22:59.480 --> 00:23:02.480
(Wait, Baby!) The expected

00:23:02.480 --> 00:23:04.770
(What’s that, Baby!) Answers

00:23:04.770 --> 00:23:07.190
(Wait a sec, Baby!) Remember them

00:23:07.190 --> 00:23:08.820
(What are we!? Baby!) For who

00:23:08.820 --> 00:23:13.710
Let’s say I wrote the correct answers on that sheet

00:23:13.710 --> 00:23:18.040
Will that change the future a year or a decade from now?

00:23:18.560 --> 00:23:23.620
The world I drew at the edge of dreams

00:23:23.620 --> 00:23:28.090
Someday I’ll race in the sky

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:33.220
Nobody can threaten my heart

00:23:33.220 --> 00:23:37.210
Nothing is correct!

00:23:40.900 --> 00:23:42.400
Numbers Club?

00:23:42.400 --> 00:23:45.150
Yeah. We’re going to investigate Numbers.

00:23:45.690 --> 00:23:48.360
I’m worried about Yuma.

00:23:48.360 --> 00:23:51.280
Sorry, but you must give up on your friends.

00:23:51.280 --> 00:23:53.070
Stop messing around!

00:23:53.070 --> 00:23:54.870
This is... fear.

00:23:54.870 --> 00:23:57.570
I don’t need your help anymore!

00:23:57.570 --> 00:24:00.410
I’ll rescue everyone on my own!

00:24:00.410 --> 00:24:09.920
\h\hThe One Who Sees All: The Fearsome Fortuneteller, Jin\h\h

00:24:00.410 --> 00:24:06.090
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZEXAL:
“The One Who Sees All: The Fearsome Fortuneteller, Jin”

00:24:06.680 --> 00:24:09.920
I’m kattobing!

00:24:11.830 --> 00:24:14.360
The answer is... 40!

00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:18.160
You must have at least
40 cards in your deck.

00:24:18.160 --> 00:24:24.580
But you can add your favorite cards
and have up to 60 cards!
